The '''Alchemist''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Farm}}. They sell various brewing ingredients.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! colspan="2" |Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" |First Interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: There is a darkness in you, &7[player].
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: I've seen it in my flames, you are destined for great things.
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: For now, you shouldn't let it get to your head.
}}
|-
| rowspan="4" class="ct" |[[Abiphone#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contact}}]]
| class="ct" |None 
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: &b✆ &fAn Abiphone? What kind of &5&owitchcraft &fis that?
&a&l[SHOW ABIPHONE]
}} 
|-
|Selecting {{Rmt|&a&l[SHOW ABIPHONE]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: &b✆ &fI see.
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: &b✆ &fTurns out I own one too. I never knew what it was called.
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: &b✆ &fSo, you want me to add you?
&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: &b✆ &fGet me a stack of &9Mutant Nether Wart&f.
}}
|-
|Selecting {{Rmt|&a&l[GIVE ITEM]}} without {{Item|Mutant Nether Wart}}.
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: &b✆ &fYou have less warts than I have on my face!}}
|-
|Selecting {{Rmt|&a&l[GIVE ITEM]}} with {{Item|Mutant Nether Wart}}.
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Alchemist&f: &b✆ &fI was right, you are indeed destined for great things.}}
|-
| rowspan="3" class="ct" |{{zone|The Garden}}
| class="ct" |None
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &aAlchemist&f: Been running low on my brewing supplies, Nether Warts are quite hard to come by these days.}}
|-
| class="ct" |Completing
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &aAlchemist&f: Project Centurion can finally begin. You've been quite the help.}}
|-
| class="ct" |Denying
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &aAlchemist&f: Unfortunate, I'll see if I can find some Nether Warts from someone else.}}
|}

